#: .\tools\templates\tools\help_cron_explainer.html:36
msgid ""
"Avoid using out-of-range values (for example minute 60), missing fields, or "
"extra spaces. Use numbers, ranges (1-5), lists (1,3,5), and steps (*/10) "
